That's not odd. A pet will overcome its reluctance to step on a square
with a cursed item if there is a non-cursed food item they want on the
same square.

> I think it is possible to teach a pet to ignore cursed items.

No. They will _temporarily_ ignore cursed items if there is food on
the square, but this will have no effect on their future avoidance of
cursed items.

